{
  "title": "Dua After Namaz For Seeking Sustenance",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIRR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nاَللّٰھُمَّ یَا سَبَبَ مَنْ لَا سَبَبَ لَهٗ \nALLAAHUMMA YAA SABABA MAN LAA SABABA LAHU\nO Allah, O the cause of one for whom there is no cause, \nیَا سَبَبَ كُلِّ ذِیْ سَبَبٍ \nYAA SABABA KULLE ZEE SABABIN\nO cause of all that have cause. \nیَا مُسَبِّبُ الْاَسْبَابِ بِغَیْرِ سَبَبٍ \nYAA MOSABBEBA BE-GHAYRE SABABIN\nO cause of causes in that where there is no cause. \nصَلِّ عَلیٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nSALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADINW\nBless Muhammad and the progeny of Muhammad. \nوَّ اَغْنِنِیْ بِحَلَالِكَ عَنْ حَرَامِكَ \nWA AGHNENEE BE-HALAALEKA A’N HARAAMEKA\nMake me needless through Your permissible from Your prohibited. \nوَ بِطَاعَتِكَ عَنْ مَعْصِیَتِكَ \nWA BE-TAA-A’TEKA A’N MA’SEYATEKA\nAnd through Your obedience from Your disobedience \nوَ بِفَضْلِكَ عَمَّنْ سِوَاكَ \nWA BE-FAZLEKA A’MMAN SEWAAKA\nand by Your Grace from others than You. \nیَا حَیُّ یَا قَیُّوْمُ \nYAA HAYYO YAA QAYYOOMO\nO the Living, O the Everlasting."
}
